          </div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__title">Cycling</div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__sub">Build VO2 max and sustain power on the bike.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="af-benefit-card">
          <div class="af-benefit-card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="13" cy="4" r="1"/><path d="M7 21l3-7-2-2 3-5"/><path d="m17 21-3.5-4.5 1.5-3.5-3-2.5"/><path d="M6 12h3l2.5-4.5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__title">Running</div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__sub">Breathe stronger on every km, sprint and hill.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="af-benefit-card">
          <div class="af-benefit-card__icon">
