          </div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__title">Swimming</div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__sub">Maximise breath control and stroke efficiency.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="af-benefit-card">
          <div class="af-benefit-card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 5v14"/><path d="M18 5v14"/><path d="M2 9h4"/><path d="M2 15h4"/><path d="M18 9h4"/><path d="M18 15h4"/><path d="M6 9h12"/><path d="M6 15h12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__title">Fitness</div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__sub">Train harder, recover faster between sets.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="af-benefit-card">
          <div class="af-benefit-card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__title">Sleep</div>
          <div class="af-benefit-card__sub">Calmer breathing for deeper, restorative sleep.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="af-benefit-card">
          <div class="af-benefit-card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
